# (5542-5544) to 50-60/05's ride past his house, Unfinished Business (6004) and The Wildlife Suffers Too (4985) to
# the later Plaguelands visit: their ground is level 54-56 and this guide starts about 53.
# Flow (2026-11-20): Western Plaguelands opening -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar -> Azshara (moved here from 50-60/04: its
# quests are 51-55, its mobs 50-55 with Magus Rimtori 55 last) -> Orgrimmar (deliveries, training) -> by way of
# Valormok (Jes'rimon's payment) to Splintertree Post -> Felwood from the Emerald Sanctuary north to Timbermaw Hold.
# The guide ends in the tunnel: 50-60/03 comes out in Winterspring and takes Felwood's southern hand-ins (Ror,
# the Sanctuary, Winna's flasket and kitten) on a south-to-north ride after Everlook. The two Felwood top-ups (to 54
# in Irontree Woods, to 55 at Felpaw Village) are gone: Azshara's 70,000 quest XP comes before Felwood now.

step Mulgris Deepriver
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears.
  accept 4984                         -- Inside

step Diseased Wolves
  tip The wolves roam the fields between Andorhal, Dalson's Tears and the Writhing Haunt. Finish them on the ride back east. Careful: the biggest are 54: pull them one at a time.
  kill 1817 quest 4984

step Dalson's Tears farmhouse
  tip The diary lies in the farmhouse, the cabinet stands inside and the outhouse is behind it. A Wandering Skeleton carries the outhouse key; Farmer Dalson comes out when you open the outhouse and carries the cabinet key.
  turnin 5058 direct
  collect 12738 @47.7,49.9 map 1422
  collect 12739 @48.1,49.7 -- Farmer Dalson
  turnin 5059 direct
  turnin 5060 direct

step Mulgris Deepriver
  turnin 4984                         -- Inside
