  tip Take a Box of Incendiaries from the crate next to Derrington for Scarlet Diversions.
  accept 5096                         -- High Executor Derrington

step Scarlet forward camp
  when !turnedin 5096
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip From the Bulwark, follow the road east into the Western Plaguelands. The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand just past Felstone Farm, between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner. Careful: the Scarlets around the tents reach 54 and the Invokers cast: come in from the side nearest the command tent and leave the others be.
  interact 176088
  complete 5096

