step Makrinni Burrowers
  tip The Makrinni Burrowers (50-51) dig in the sands just east of the ruins, on the way north-east; they and the buried caches there give up the Highborne Treasure Fragments.
  collect 246684 quest 91568

step Ekkal
  tip On north-east across the middle of Azshara: Ekkal camps by the road.
  accept 86746                        -- Ekkal: The Legashi Threat, the satyrs north of the blood elves' camp

step Kim'jael
  tip Ride north-east to the goblin's camp on the cliffs above the Bay of Storms, just north of the blood elves.
  accept 3601

step Thalassian Base Camp
  tip The blood elves camp on the cliffs in the north-east, by the Bay of Storms. Kim'jael's four pieces of equipment lie in the crates around the camp; the Blood Elf Arcanists carry Izvi's wand.
  tip Careful: a Blackmaw Thrall, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the west edge of the camp: work the blood elves from its east side.
  kill 6199 quest 3505.1
  kill 6198 quest 3505.2 @56.2,29.9
  collect 10717 quest 3601
  collect 10715 quest 3601
  collect 10718 quest 3601
  collect 10722 quest 3601
  collect 246680 quest 91569.1        -- Mana-Siphoning Wand, from the Blood Elf Arcanists

step Magus Rimtori's camp
  tip Rimtori's camp is at the east end of the base camp. Read the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning there: on Forever the Sin'dorei Tome beside it then asks for the seals of the camp's three officers.
  complete 3505 @59.53,31.47 map 1447 era
  turnin 3505                         -- Kaldorei Tome of Summoning
  accept 91497                        -- Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning: Seals of the Sin'dorei

step Seals of the Sin'dorei
  tip Each of the camp's three officers (53) carries a seal: Lieutenant Suncrest in the middle of the camp, Ranger Lydrea at its eastern end, and Magister Hawkhelm, who walks its western half: take him on the east side of his walk, where the arrow points.
  tip Careful: the Blackmaw Thrall, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the camp's western edge, close to the far end of Hawkhelm's walk: wait for Hawkhelm to come back east.
  collect 246725 quest 91497.1        -- Seal of the Warden, from Lieutenant Suncrest
  collect 246721 quest 91497.2        -- Seal of the Warrior, from Magister Hawkhelm
  collect 246722 quest 91497.3        -- Seal of the Ranger, from Ranger Lydrea

step Magus Rimtori
  tip Back to the Sin'dorei Tome: hand in the seals, then use it to call Magus Rimtori.
  tip Careful: Rimtori is level 55, and which crystal is linked to him is random: each of the other two summons a hostile infernal instead. Start at full health.
  turnin 91497                        -- Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning
  accept 91500                        -- An Explosive Gambit
  collect 10597 quest 91500.1         -- Head of Magus Rimtori
  accept 91538                        -- Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning: for Jediga in Valormok

step The Legashi satyrs
  tip The Legashi satyrs (51-52) hold the hills north of the blood elves' camp: Ekkal wants five of each kind.
  tip Careful: Prince Halanox (55, elite) stands among the satyrs at the north-east end of their hills, around 67,19: take the satyrs nearer the camp and leave him be.
  kill 6200 quest 86746.1             -- Legashi Satyr
  kill 6201 quest 86746.2             -- Legashi Rogue
  kill 6202 quest 86746.3             -- Legashi Hellcaller

