step Irontree Woods
  tip Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo, and their organs are Kelek's.
