step Felpaw Village
  tip Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Deadwood Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%.
  tip If one drops a Deadwood Ritual Totem (about one kill in thirty), right-click it; don't stay to farm one. Kernda in Timbermaw Hold takes it only from Neutral with the Timbermaw (the Timbermaw Hold reputation guide gets you there): now if they already are, or on the last guide's pass of the cave.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3
